  << /ActualText (START\n\nDisplay Mini\055Game\n\nSet score to 0\nSet question number to 1\n\nWHILE there are questions remaining\n\n    Display question\n\n    Display possible answers\n\n    Get learner\047s answer\n\n    IF learner\047s answer is correct THEN\n        Display \042Correct\041\042\n        Add points to score\n    ELSE\n        Display \042Incorrect\042\n        Display the correct answer\n    END IF\n\n    Update learner\047s progress\n\n    Move to the next question\n\nEND WHILE\n\nDisplay final score\n\nIF score meets the required target THEN\n    Display \042Well done\041\042\nELSE\n    Display \042Keep practising\041\042\nEND IF\n\nSave game result\n\nEND)
